{title: 183 - I Will Sing of Jesus' Love}
{subtitle: SDA Hymnal #183 • }
{lyricist: }
{composer: }
{key: Bb}
{time: 4/4}
{tempo: Moderato}
{meta: hymn_number 183}
{meta: category Jesus Christ - }

{start_of_verse: Verse 1}
[Bb]I will sing of [F7]Jesus'[Bb] love, Sing of[F7] Him, who[Eb] first loved[Bb] me;
[Bb]For He left [Bb7]bright [Eb]worlds above, And [Bb]died on [F7]Cal-va[Bb]ry.
[Bb7]I will [Eb]sing of [Bb]Jesus' love[F] Endless[Bb] praise[Eb] my[F] heart shall give;
[Gm]He has died [D]that I [Eb]might live I will [Bb]sing His [F7]love to [Bb]me.
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_chorus: Refrain}
[Bb]I [F7]will [Bb]sing [F7]of [Eb]Jesus [Bb]love
[Bb]Endless [Bb7]praise [Eb]my [Bb]heart [F7]shall [Bb]give;
[Bb7]He [Eb]has [Bb]died [F]that [Bb]I [Eb]might [F]live
[Gm]I [D]will [Eb]sing [Bb]His [F7]love [Bb]to me.
{end_of_chorus}

{start_of_verse: Verse 2}
[Bb]O [F7]the [Bb]depths [F7]of [Eb]love [Bb]divine!
[Bb]Earth [Bb7]or [Eb]heaven [Bb]can [F7]never [Bb]know
[Bb7]How [Eb]that [Bb]sin [F]as [Bb]dark [Eb]as [F]mine
[Gm]can [D]be [Eb]made [Bb]as [F7]white [Bb]as snow.
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_verse: Verse 3}
[Bb]Nothing [F7]good [Bb]for [F7]Him [Eb]I've [Bb]done;
[Bb]How [Bb7]could [Eb]He [Bb]such [F7]love [Bb]bestow?
[Bb7]Lord, [Eb]I [Bb]own [F]my [Bb]heart [Eb]is [F]won,
[Gm]help [D]me [Eb]now [Bb]my [F7]love [Bb]to show.
{end_of_verse}
